# Every path needs the maintainer's review. The organisation ruleset requires a
# code owner's approval on main, and without this file that rule has no owner to
# ask for.
#
# The paths below are listed again on purpose: they decide what CI runs, which
# packages are restored and how a release is cut, so they keep an owner even if
# the catch-all is ever narrowed.
*                         @Theauxm
/.github/                 @Theauxm
/Directory.Build.props    @Theauxm
/Directory.Packages.props @Theauxm
/global.json              @Theauxm
/.releaserc.json          @Theauxm
/package.json             @Theauxm
/package-lock.json        @Theauxm
/.config/                 @Theauxm
